    Vendor bert-base-uncased tokenizer files locally for RAM++
    
    RAM++'s text encoder loads its tokenizer via BertTokenizer.from_pretrained
    ("bert-base-uncased"), which normally hits the Hugging Face Hub -- unreachable
    from the GPU cluster's no-internet compute nodes. from_pretrained accepts a
    local folder just as well as a hub id, so vocab.txt/tokenizer_config.json/
    config.json are now vendored under recognize-anything/pretrained/bert-base-uncased/,
    and load_ram_plus uses that folder when present, falling back to the hub id
    otherwise (e.g. on a dev machine with internet).
    
    Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

